<h3 class="help-documentation">Module Description</h3>

<p>The Assessments module of the Schools Portal allows Partner School staff to view upcoming assessment tasks due for students. It outlines:</p>
<ul>
    <li>The course the assessment is for</li>
    <li>The due date of the assessment</li>
    <li>The students linked to the assessment</li>
    <li>Any approved assessment provisions for each student</li>
    <li>Any instructions provided by the class teacher for the Partner School in how to manage the assessment</li>
    <li>Any files provided by the class teacher associated with the assessment</li>
</ul>>

<img src="~/_content/Constellation.Presentation.Schools/images/schools/help/Assessments.png" class="screenshot" />

<p>Additionally, for paper-based exam assessments, ACCs are able to upload scanned copies of student exams for submission to the class teacher.</p>

<p>All files uploaded must be in PDF format, and have a maximum file size of 10mb. The system will not allow any other file types to be uploaded.</p>

<h4>To upload a file</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Expand the assessment</li>
    <li>Click the Upload File button</li>
    <li>Select a student from the dropdown list</li>
    <li>Select the file from the local computer</li>
    <li>Click the Submit button</li>
</ul>


<img src="~/_content/Constellation.Presentation.Schools/images/schools/help/Assessments Upload.png" class="screenshot" />

<h3 class="help-documentation">Further Assistance</h3>

<p>If you require further assistance using the Schools Portal, please contact the Technology Support Team on 1300 610 733 or via <a href="mailto:support@aurora.nsw.edu.au">support@aurora.nsw.edu.au</a>. Please note that support is available during school hours only.</p>